Read AGENTS.md first and follow it as the canonical repo guide.

Project focus:
- coronary centerline trees
- topology prior
- branch shape prior
- SCCT18 labeling
- CPR / curved MIP visualization

Rules:
- user-facing chat in Chinese by default
- do not modify ASOCA2020 raw data unless explicitly asked
- prefer outputs_reorganized over loose outputs
- prefer vessel_seg package code over new one-off scripts
- when output structure changes, update docs and tests
- do not create ad-hoc naming like final2/debug_new/tmp_case

Preferred docs:
- docs/coronary_analysis_master_blueprint.md
- docs/data_output_reorganization.md

Preferred locations:
- stable code -> vessel_seg/
- wrappers/migrations -> scripts/
- exploratory notes -> docs/ or notebooks/
